    "body": "My concern is that if you're not used to thinking about the modularity of starship, it's not clear why we even need the segment names (and I think it's a little much to expect someone to read the parts on styling before looking for a setting).\r\n\r\nSo the segment section is valuable to someone who knows a lot about starship and wants to configure it in detail, but if you're a new user, it's just confusing as to what it is and why there's so much space dedicated to it.",
